<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html id="html-block-html" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/common--theme/base/css/html-block.css"/></head><body>
<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.rawgit.com/deadsurgeon42/scp-sources/6cf60652/scp-4000-samualism/termynal.css" />
</head>
<body>

<style>
:root {
    --color-bg: #002200;
    --color-text: #77CC77;
    --color-text-subtle: #55AA55;
}

[data-termynal] {
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 0;

    background-color: #002200;
    border: 3px solid #55AA55;
    color: #77CC77;

    height: 260px;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 12px;
}

[data-termynal]:before {
    display: none;
}

</style>

<div id="termynal" data-termynal data-ty-typeDelay="110">
  <span data-ty data-ty-prompt="|">登入請求已發送</span>
  <span data-ty-prompt="|">AUTHORIZING...</span>
  <span data-ty="progress"></span>
  <span data-ty></span>
  <span data-ty data-ty-prompt="|">如果您非常肯定您是應該在此的，那我肯定你一定知道，</span>
  <span data-ty data-ty-prompt="|">黑月是否嚎叫？</span>
  <span data-ty="input" data-ty-prompt=">">如果他感覺如此，我猜。</span>
  <span data-ty data-ty-prompt="|">不要做任何愚蠢的事。</span>
  <span data-ty data-ty-prompt="|">請在下方輸入您的憑證，GABRIEL JADE。</span>
</div>

<!-- include and initialise termynal.js -->
<script src="https://cdn.rawgit.com/deadsurgeon42/scp-sources/6cf60652/scp-4000-samualism/termynal.js" data-termynal-container="#termynal"></script>

<script type="text/javascript" src="/common--javascript/html-block-iframe.js"></script></body>
<script type="text/javascript" src="/common--javascript/html-block-iframe.js"></script></body></html>